ADD — Iteration 3 (AIDAP)

(Architectural Design Document — Iteration 3 Deliverables)

Iteration 3 focuses on architecture evaluation (ATAM), risk mitigation, refinement of system elements, and consolidation of quality attributes validated through prototypes in Iteration 2.

Seven ADD Steps — Iteration 3
Step 1 — Confirm Design Requirements

Iteration 3 introduces the following new and refined drivers:

Functional:

Improve retrieval quality and latency for RAG responses

Add admin dashboards for monitoring ingestion status and model usage

Harden LMS adapters for error conditions

Support multi-tenant deployment

Quality Attributes (≥3 as required):

Performance — reduce retrieval + generation latency under load

Security/Compliance — enforce tenant isolation + data-access auditing

Availability — ensure ingestion pipeline resilience


